   "delivery" : "",
   "departmentNumber" : "32",
   "description" : "<div class=\"product-details-wrapper-au\">\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-detail-dsc-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"product-detail-title-wrapper\">\n<h5 class=\"product-detail-title\">Description</h5>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-detail-dsc\">\n<h2>Thermoflask Coffee Mugs 2 Piece Set</h2>\nThe perfect gift for coffee and tea lovers. This set includes a 474 ml tumbler and a 355 ml mug, great for home or on the go. Made from durable 18/8 stainless steel with double wall vacuum insulation to keep drinks hot for up to 6 hours. Splash proof slider lids and non-slip silicone bases add convenience and stability. Whether gifting or getting, it&rsquo;s a cozy essential for any day.<br />\n<br />\nThis product features:\n<ul class=\"in-page-list-style\">\n\t<li>Press in splash proof slider lid</li>\n\t<li>Built in non-slip silicone coaster</li>\n\t<li>18/8 food grade stainless steel. BPA Free</li>\n\t<li>Limited lifetime warranty</li>\n\t<li>Top rack dishwasher safe and easy to clean by hand</li>\n\t<li>Convenient easy carry handle</li>\n\t<li>Durable powder coat finish</li>\n\t<li>Temp-Lock technology keeps drinks&nbsp;hot for 6 hours</li>\n\t<li>474 ml and 355 ml</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"clearboth\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
